  "goodToKnow": "Der Filmemacher (die Filmemacherin) is a filmmaker, often used for documentary or independent directors. Der Regisseur is the director. The Neuer Deutscher Film (New German Cinema) of the 1960s–80s produced Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Werner Herzog, Wim Wenders and Margarethe von Trotta. Recent Oscar successes include Das Leben der Anderen (2007) and Im Westen nichts Neues (2023). Plural: die Filmemacher."
